    "axis": "clarity",
    "evidence": "The headline, supporting sentence, filter controls, selected-vector state, observable signals, and prominent “Continue to scored replay” CTA create a mostly understandable path across all viewports. However, the desktop vector grid visibly clips card IDs and titles at the left edge, the kill-chain labels rely on unexplained jargon, and neither “scored replay” nor the relationship between the stage map, vector list, and detail panel is explained clearly enough for an unaided demo. Mobile/tablet header navigation also hides later destinations behind horizontal scrolling.",
